msgctxt "80"
msgid "Say, what sort of work do you do, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "I run an orphanage called Morning Glory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Wow. Taking care of all those children is quite a task."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's not easy, sure... but nothing makes me happier than\r\n"
"seeing them smile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Haha, that's wonderful. I'm glad to know you enjoy your\r\n"
"work, Kiryu-san... and what vital work it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Now let's get this hole started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Speaking of the orphanage, Kiryu-san. How many kids do you\r\n"
"have there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Nine, all in elementary school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"And you take care of them all by yourself? Do you have any\r\n"
"helpers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"No, but the oldest girl, Haruka, takes on a lot of that\r\n"
"responsibility. She'll be starting sixth grade next month."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"And the chores are divided up between all the kids. Everyone\r\n"
"has to help out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"How wonderful. Too many kids these days sit around watching\r\n"
"TV while their parents do all the work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Now, shall we head to the next hole?"
msgstr ""

